{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"8743","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v10014","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"斉藤カホ(白井恵利子、黒井恵利子)","creatorId":"vndb:s4098","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2827","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4098","name":"斉藤カホ(白井恵利子、黒井恵利子)","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:78519","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"中森南文里(一砂、守河辰巳)","creatorId":"vndb:s1617","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2300","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1617","name":"中森南文里(一砂、守河辰巳)","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:22347","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c68798","characterName":"フェリア・神田＝モンデリヒト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59082","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217714"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23184"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68798"},"originalCharacterName":"フェリア・神田＝モンデリヒト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"138"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a genius girl who went to a university in Germany."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also quite famous worldwide as a researcher, and is the only teacher at the school to have completed a doctoral course. She is currently submitting her dissertation to an academic conference, and while waiting for the results, she is teaching on the side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a teacher, but she is younger than her students. She is selfish, egoistic, arrogant, and super-cheeky. Basically, she thinks students are low-brained idiots who are no better than livestock."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of her genius, the test questions she makes are extremely difficult, and it is extremely difficult to get more than 10 points (of course, the perfect score is 100 points)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She thinks that the main character is no better than a monkey."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68798"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の非常勤講師で化学担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"飛び級により海外の有名学院で最年少の博士号を取得した天才。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はどこかの研究室にいるらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"科学部の顧問を引き受けており、自分の待機室である化学準備室を科学部室として提供している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23184","sourceWorkId":"8743","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｂ：58cm　Ｗ：45cm　Ｈ：62cm"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ドイツの大学を飛び級で卒業した天才少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界的に研究者としてもかなり有名で、学園の教師では唯一博士課程を修了している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、学会に論文を提出中で、その結果待ちの片手間で教師をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"経歴は誰にも負けない立派なものだが・・・でも、基本的に子供。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立場は教師だが、学生よりも年下の先生。強気で我侭で傲慢、さらに超生意気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に学生を家畜以下の低脳馬鹿と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天才ゆえに彼女の作るテスト問題は超難問で、１０点以上取るのが至難の業である（当然１００点満点）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のことはサル以下と思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「１２cmか・・・平均より小さいよね？これ・・・」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59082"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36bdee116e12c7ad1112460a0e34043bd114011a38d1373ac162d080cc22a9fa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/171320b5d534e69a8f2f81ab993d18e68d55e94b6201d219f775709fa61bde97.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c80304","characterName":"矢村 和美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59101","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217714"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23183"],"vndbCharacterId":"c80304"},"originalCharacterName":"矢村 和美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"151"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Games, Going to the Amusement Park"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Favorite Food: Chocolate Cake."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c80304"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『てすた』（同ブランドの作品）のヒロインの一人で、忠広の親友直紀の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"活発かつ外向的な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"去年から忠広と同じクラスなので、わりとよく会話をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『てすた』より1年以上経っているので、ちょっとだけバストが大きくなっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23183","sourceWorkId":"8743","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の1年生。主人公と同い年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは幼なじみで、小さい頃から同じクラスだったりしたことも多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"得意科目は英語、苦手科目はあえて言えば美術。趣味は音楽鑑賞＆CD集め。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸が小さいのをちょっと気にしている。女子校生らしく、噂話とかもそれなりに興味がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"友人は多いが、つるむのは嫌いなのであまり固まって行動はしていない。だけど嫌われないタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子どもの頃は男勝りタイプで男子と一緒に遊んでいた。だから主人公とも同性の友達に近い感覚でいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周りの友人の影響からか、性的なことにも最近興味が出てきている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あのさ、今日家に行っていい？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59101"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23183","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23183","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23183","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23183","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c59e954eadf789d08d031e16d1ad75943d2b48a8f8c3e4c59fb0e9653ef03ad.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/27f18b99a764785071daca112db855399189fce3c0c75ea028a26181a5b05b67.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217714:59101:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c80456","characterName":"真井 めぐみ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55247","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"217714"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23182"],"vndbCharacterId":"c80456"},"originalCharacterName":"真井 めぐみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"168"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の最上級生で、科学部の部長をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"負けん気がかなり強く、言いたいことは誰にでも気兼ねなく言う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"忠広とは幼馴染みで、以前はお互いの家でよく遊ぶほどだったが、最近はとある理由により疎遠気味で、会ってもケンカが多くなっている。また、美織ととても仲が良く、妹のように思っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23182","sourceWorkId":"8743","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園の最上級生で、科学部の部長をしている。負けん気がかなり強く、言いたいことは誰にでも気兼ねなく言う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"社交的でどんな男でも仲良く話しかけるので、女ばかりでなく男友達も多い。恋愛には結びつかないことが多いが、本人はそれをまったく気にしていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"忠広とは幼なじみで、以前はお互いの家でよく遊ぶほどだったが、最近はとある理由による疎遠気味で、会ってもケンカが多くなっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、美織ととても仲が良く、妹のように思っている。だけど彼女と比べて身長のわりに胸がないのを密かに気にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、彼女の発案で、学園の噂の科学的解決を図るべく、夜の校舎に侵入することになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55247"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23182","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"168 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23182","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23182","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23182","sourceWorkId":"8743","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2e4329df503df89dd37396dc79126ce00ce17b611e3bd026b17e67ab22fc292.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a1bca585b32494f7c05e48971c0f00d7e2417c6027e42104465c62cf89ebc29e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山川琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1173","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1173","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1173","name":"山川 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:217714:55247:4799:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c80457","characterName":"志野 美織","so